# M5Stack Tab5 (atomvm/build.sh esp32p4_pre_c6_tab5, esp32p4_c6_tab5). Loaded by ESP-IDF after
# sdkconfig.babytalk and sdkconfig.babytalk.esp32p4, only for a *_tab5 target. The Tab5 has the
# same ESP32-P4 + ESP32-C6 chips as the other P4 targets but a different board, and the C6's
# SDIO link is wired differently, which is a build-time setting (esp_hosted's pins).

# The on-board ESP32-C6 is wired to CLK 12, CMD 13, D0..D3 11/10/9/8, RESET 15 (SDIO2_CK G12,
# CMD G13, D0-D3 G11/G10/G9/G8, RESET G15 -- M5Stack's Tab5 pinmap). esp_hosted carries the
# board as a preset of its own: the default (the ESP32-P4-Function-EV-Board's wiring) is
# CLK 18, CMD 19, D0..D3 14/15/16/17, RESET 54, and it never answers.
# CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_P4_DEV_BOARD_NONE is not set
CONFIG_ESP32P4_TAB5_C6_BOARD=y
